Third-party software used at runtime
------------------------------------
MicroCut runs FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) as a separate program (`ffmpeg`, `ffprobe`) to read and write video. FFmpeg
is not part of MicroCut, is not linked into it and is not distributed with it. FFmpeg is licensed under the LGPL 2.1+
or, depending on the build, the GPL 2+; those terms apply to FFmpeg itself. Anyone who ships an FFmpeg binary together
with MicroCut must comply with the license of that FFmpeg build.
